{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-06-10 11:00:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS TO SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS AT THE POWDERMET2022 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON POWDER METALLURGY AND PARTICULATE MATERIALS', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , JUNE 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) WILL SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS AND TECHNOLOGIES FOR METALS AND MATERIALS PROCESSING APPLICATIONS AT THE POWDERMET2022 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON POWDER METALLURGY AND PARTICULATE MATERIALS FROM JUNE 12-15 AT THE OREGON CONVENTION CENTER IN PORTLAND, OREGON.'}